There was recent discussion of finding secret doors.
One way is to cast force bolt at the spot on the wall.
If the cast is successful, you don't typo the direction,
and there's a secret door in that spot, then it will be
destroyed and the start of the corridor without a door
will be visible.  Useful for any character with hungerless
force bolt so some early wizards will be able to use
this approach if they can't find the stairs down.  It does
however wake up any nymphs or other sleeping
monsters on the current level because of the noise.

If I understand correctly hitting a monster with force
bolt does not wake up sleeping monsters but if you
miss there's a chance of waking.


